    <dt>实线</dt><dd><p>红玫瑰花束</p><hr class="wb-lyn-hr"><p>粉芍药花束</p></dd>
    <dt>虚线</dt><dd><p>向日葵花束</p><hr class="wb-lyn-hr wb-lyn-hr--dash"><p>白郁金香</p></dd>
    <dt>居中分组名</dt><dd><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-hl" data-expand="wb-lyn-dvx"><i class="wb-lyn-ln"></i><span>鲜花</span><i class="chev"></i><i class="wb-lyn-ln"></i></button><div class="expand" id="wb-lyn-dvx" data-open="true"><div><ul class="wb-lyn-items"><li><span>红玫瑰花束</span><span class="price"><small>¥</small>199</span></li><li><span>粉芍药花束</span><span class="price"><small>¥</small>239</span></li></ul></div></div></dd>
    <dt>靠左分组名</dt><dd><div class="wb-lyn-hl"><span>绿植</span><i class="wb-lyn-ln"></i><small>12 款</small></div></dd>
    <dt>竖向分割线</dt><dd><div class="wb-lyn-vrow"><span>库存 86</span><i class="wb-lyn-vr"></i><span>售价 ¥199</span><i class="wb-lyn-vr"></i><span>建国路店</span></div><div class="wb-lyn-vrow wb-lyn-vrow--act"><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-act" data-wb-toast="已进入编辑">编辑</button><i class="wb-lyn-vr"></i><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-act" data-wb-toast="已复制商品">复制</button><i class="wb-lyn-vr"></i><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-act wb-lyn-act--danger" data-wb-toast="已移入回收站">删除</button></div></dd>
    <dt>分区带</dt><dd><p>订单信息</p><div class="wb-lyn-band" style="margin: var(--s-3) 0"></div><p>配送信息</p></dd>
  </dl></div></div>
</article>

<article class="demo" data-cid="WB-LAYT-025" data-name="固钉吸附容器" data-cat="LAYT">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">固钉吸附容器</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：筛选条与操作条滚动到顶部后吸附固定</p>
