    <div class="wb-lyn-mm__panel" id="wb-lyn-mm-shop" data-open="true" role="region" aria-label="商品分类">
      <div class="wb-lyn-mm__cols">
        <div class="wb-lyn-mm__col"><h3>鲜花<span>4 款</span></h3><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开红玫瑰花束"><b>红玫瑰花束</b><small>11 支装 199 元起</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开粉芍药花束"><b>粉芍药花束</b><small>9 支装 239 元起</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开向日葵花束"><b>向日葵花束</b><small>6 支装 159 元起</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开白郁金香"><b>白郁金香</b><small>10 支装 179 元起</small></button></div>
        <div class="wb-lyn-mm__col"><h3>绿植<span>3 款</span></h3><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开龟背竹盆栽"><b>龟背竹盆栽</b><small>中型盆 159 元起</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开蓝绣球盆栽"><b>蓝绣球盆栽</b><small>陶盆 129 元起</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开多肉组合盆"><b>多肉组合盆</b><small>组合盆 89 元起</small></button></div>
        <div class="wb-lyn-mm__col"><h3>礼盒与花器<span>2 款</span></h3><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开花礼盒"><b>花礼盒</b><small>牛皮纸盒 259 元起</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开干花花瓶摆件"><b>干花花瓶摆件</b><small>陶瓷花瓶 129 元起</small></button></div>
        <button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__feat" data-wb-toast="已打开粉芍药花束"><img src="../../kit/assets/photo/product-peony-pink.webp" alt=""><div><b>粉芍药花束</b><span class="tag" data-tone="price">热销</span><span class="price"><small>¥</small>239</span></div></button>
