        <button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__store" data-wb-toast="已打开建国路店"><b>建国路店</b><span>黄浦区建国东路 18 号</span><span>09:00 至 21:00</span><span>配送范围 5 公里</span><span class="tag" data-tone="success">营业中</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__store" data-wb-toast="已打开徐汇滨江店"><b>徐汇滨江店</b><span>徐汇区龙腾大道 2000 号</span><span>09:30 至 21:30</span><span>配送范围 5 公里</span><span class="tag" data-tone="success">营业中</span></button>
        <button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__store" data-wb-toast="已打开浦东世纪店"><b>浦东世纪店</b><span>浦东新区世纪大道 100 号</span><span>09:00 至 20:30</span><span>配送范围 6 公里</span><span class="tag" data-tone="success">营业中</span></button>
        <div class="wb-lyn-mm__col"><h3>门店服务</h3><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开到店自提"><b>到店自提</b><small>下单后两小时可取</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开花艺课程"><b>花艺课程</b><small>每周六开课</small></button><button type="button" class="wb-lyn-mm__lnk" data-wb-toast="已打开定制预约"><b>定制预约</b><small>婚礼与企业订花</small></button></div>
